ue; the other candidates either lack stress\u2011handling evidence or have more serious teamwork/communication weaknesses.\n**Remaining uncertainties:**\n- Concrete evidence of B\u2019s teamwork and crew\u2011communication abilities.\n- Any positive teamwork or communication data for A, C, or D that could offset their other weaknesses.\n**What would change my vote:** If a candidate (especially A, C, or D) were shown to have strong, documented stress resilience **and** demonstrable teamwork/communication strengths that outweigh B\u2019s communication tone issue, I would reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
